<title>FRANCE: Seita 1996 net attrib profit 786 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Seita 1996 net attrib profit 786 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Net attributable		   786  vs   684</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)	   6.60  vs  5.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 1,244  vs   984</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional     1,423  vs 1,071</p>
<p>    Financial			    179  vs    87</p>
<p>NOTE - Seita's 1996 results were released in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
